# The swap journey with the follow-up worded as an extension of the drawing on stage: the same beat, and the car is asked to be gone on from rather than swapped as a whole.
# A scripted walk through one live conversation, played on the real brain. Never a replay. (See car.journey for what each step does.)

# three seconds of idle screen before the first key
hold 3
car: type | Show me the main parts of a car
rest
hold 3
swap: type | Extend the current drawing: swap the engine for an electric motor and battery, and keep everything else as it is
rest
hold 4
